<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES ITINERARIES FOR PAKISTAN AND SHARJAH CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES ITINERARIES FOR PAKISTAN AND SHARJAH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itineraries for West</p>
<p>Indies' cricket tour to Pakistan and Sharjah Cup tournament:</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> Nov 1	  - West Indies v Sri Lanka,</p>
<p>		    1-day tournament		 - Lahore</p>
<p> Nov 3	  - West Indies v South Africa,</p>
<p>		    1-day tournament		 - Lahore</p>
<p> Nov 4	  - West Indies v Pakistan,</p>
<p>		    1-day tournament		 - Lahore</p>
<p> Nov 8	  - 1-day tournament final	 - Lahore</p>
<p> Nov 11-14    - 4-day match			- Rawalpindi</p>
<p> Nov 17-21    - 1st test v Pakistan	    - Peshawar</p>
<p> Nov 24-26    - 3-day match			- Hyderabad</p>
<p> Nov 29-Dec 3 - 2nd test v Pakistan	    - Rawalpindi</p>
<p> Dec 6-10     - 3rd test v Pakistan	    - Karachi</p>
<p>Sharjah Cup</p>
<p> Dec 11   India v England</p>
<p> Dec 12   Pakistan v West Indies</p>
<p> Dec 13   England v West Indies</p>
<p> Dec 14   Pakistan v India</p>
<p> Dec 15   Pakistan v England</p>
<p> Dec 16   India v West Indies</p>
<p> Dec 19   Final</p>
